 "remarks": "First time on the market in over 25 years!! This 3-bedroom 2 bath condominium is located within the sought-after peaceful Candlelight Terrace Association complex. This home features a spacious floor plan and a private carport to protect your car from the New England weather, along with an additional space for owner parking. Additional features include a front to back living room, a dedicated dining area that will accommodate large gatherings and a huge outdoor balcony. The primary bedroom is front to back as well and is large enough for a King bedroom suite, with plenty of room for a sitting area. Enjoy your own 3-piece bathroom with shower stall, a walk-in closet completes this room. The 2nd and 3rd bedroom are very spacious; one has a double sized closet and the other has a walk-in closet.  This complex is situated in the convenient Mid City/Ridgeway area running right along the tranquil Rippowam River. The monthly HOA provides exceptional budgeting predictability by covering heat, hot water, sewer, trash, snow removal, grounds maintenance, and flood insurance. Residents enjoy access to a sparkling in-ground pool, and outdoor grilling areas. There is a private caged storage unit in the basement.  This property is a commuter's dream, located just minutes to all major highways and the Metro North line for an easy ride into NYC in under an hour. The vibrant Stamford downtown is at your fingertips! Come bring your vision and imagination and make this your palace!",
